  "question": {
    "text": "In a workshop, there are five machines and the probability of any one of them to be out of service on a day is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> . If the probability that at most two machines will be out of service on the same day is <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mi>k</mi></math> is equal to",
